  "text": "### 3.2 Withdrawals  \n**Withdrawal Methods:**\n- ATM withdrawal (cash, max £500/day)\n- Bank transfer (to another account, no limit)\n- Teller withdrawal (branch, no limit)  \n**Restrictions:** None. Easy access at any time.  \n**Processing:**\n- ATM withdrawals: Immediate\n- Transfers out: 1–2 business days (FPS immediate, BACS next day)\n- Teller: Immediate (if cash available at branch)",
